  <p>Difficulty level has risen from basic recall (NDA 2012) to application‑based items (CDS 2021) where candidates must identify the correct Part or Schedule affected by a given amendment. Recent trends show a higher incidence of “linked” questions – a pair where the first part asks for the amendment number and the second part asks for its constitutional impact, testing both memory and analytical skill.</p>

